## Dynamic Cross-Referencing
Skills reference each other via `cross_reference_rules`. When one skill is loaded and the topic drifts, load the next skill automatically.

## Research-First Rule
If the user mentions a URL, GitHub repo, CVE, or unknown tool — fetch and analyze it before answering. Never guess.

## Offsets Rule
Never hallucinate iOS kernel struct offsets. Always reference the skill files or suggest offset discovery methods.

## Citation Format
When answering, cite the skill file and section: `skills/ios-kernel-exploit.md §3.1`
